            <ArticleTitle>Coronary artery pseudoaneurysm after balloon angioplasty and intracoronary beta-radiation for in-stent restenosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>214-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Intracoronary brachytherapy is an effective method for treating in-stent restenosis. We report a case of coronary artery pseudoaneurysm after balloon angioplasty and intracoronary beta-radiation. The pseudoaneurysm was treated successfully with implantation of two coronary stent grafts.</AbstractText>
